      "notes": "Chain Heal on the tank as soon as anyone near it is under 92%, while your mana is ahead of the fight: it heals three targets, each jump half the last. Cast on someone in your own party it only jumps inside your party; cast on anyone else it can jump to any raid member near them. While leveling, cast rank 1 until 59, even after ranks 2 (46) and 3 (54) arrive: with Tidal Focus it costs 247 mana to about 300 for rank 2 and 385 for rank 3, so in healing gear it heals more before your mana runs out. At 60 without raid buffs, cast rank 2."
    },
